WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:09,510
What time is your flight tonight?

2
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:11,510
Your dad is ready to drive to pick you up. No need

3
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:12,710
I've arranged for someone to pick me up

4
00:00:12,710 --> 00:00:15,310
It's too late today. You guys go to bed early. I'll just stay in the hotel.

5
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:16,310
How can that be done?

6
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:17,310
It’s not easy to return home

7
00:00:17,310 --> 00:00:18,710
What do you think about staying in a hotel on the first day?

8
00:00:18,710 --> 00:00:20,110
It’s not like there isn’t room for you at home

9
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:22,910
Your mother usually cleans the room. You can live in it when you come back. Dad, what are you talking about?

10
00:00:22,910 --> 00:00:24,710
The signal on the plane was not very good, so I hung up first.

11
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:26,870
The plane is about to land

12
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:28,870
Passengers please remember to wear your seat belts

13
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:30,870
Don’t run or linger in the aisles
